@startuml F0.7-b-certificado-revogado
title F0.7-b — Certificado revogado
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Verificador" as Verificador
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "Web Crypto API" as Crypto
participant "CertificadoController" as Ctrl
participant "VerificarCertificadoUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Verificador -> WebApp: hash revogado
WebApp -> Ctrl: GET certificado
Ctrl -> UC: execute(hash)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT certificado
Postgres --> UC: status=REVOGADO
UC --> Ctrl: payload
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 + REVOGADO

WebApp -> WebApp: GET /.well-known/jwks.json
WebApp -> Crypto: SubtleCrypto.verify
Crypto --> WebApp: true

note right of WebApp
  Assinatura ainda confere:
  documento foi emitido de verdade
  antes da revogação
end note

WebApp --> Verificador: badge warning "Revogado"\n+ dados históricos

@enduml
